{
 "voice": "am_michael",
 "duration": 379.333,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "scene": "forest",
   "text": "Deep in a magical forest, where colorful flowers danced in the breeze, and sunlight sparkled through the trees, lived a curious little boy named Tuca.",
   "t": 6.3,
   "d": 11.631,
   "file": "narration/lines/00.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "scene": "forest",
   "text": "Tuca loved exploring. Every day, he discovered something new.",
   "t": 19.361,
   "d": 4.56,
   "file": "narration/lines/01.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "scene": "forest",
   "text": "But one beautiful morning, he was about to experience an adventure unlike any other.",
   "t": 25.091,
   "d": 6.25,
   "file": "narration/lines/02.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "scene": "sound",
   "text": "As he walked through the forest, something strange caught his attention.",
   "t": 35.601,
   "d": 4.599,
   "file": "narration/lines/03.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "scene": "sound",
   "text": "A soft sound came from behind a bush.",
   "t": 41.759,
   "d": 2.886,
   "file": "narration/lines/04.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "scene": "sound",
   "text": "Curious, Tuca slowly approached.",
   "t": 46.726,
   "d": 2.516,
   "file": "narration/lines/05.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "scene": "sound",
   "text": "He moved a few leaves aside... and couldn't believe his eyes.",
   "t": 50.541,
   "d": 4.184,
   "file": "narration/lines/06.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "There, resting on the soft grass, was a little dinosaur egg.",
   "t": 57.665,
   "d": 4.425,
   "file": "narration/lines/07.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "It was beautiful, with tiny spots, and a warm golden glow.",
   "t": 63.52,
   "d": 4.229,
   "file": "narration/lines/08.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "But something was wrong.",
   "t": 68.919,
   "d": 1.811,
   "file": "narration/lines/09.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "The egg was all alone.",
   "t": 71.899,
   "d": 2.015,
   "file": "narration/lines/10.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "Tuca looked around, searching for its mother.",
   "t": 75.734,
   "d": 2.961,
   "file": "narration/lines/11.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "He checked behind the trees, looked beneath the bushes, and even listened carefully for any nearby sounds.",
   "t": 79.346,
   "d": 7.404,
   "file": "narration/lines/12.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "But the forest was silent.",
   "t": 88.44,
   "d": 2.099,
   "file": "narration/lines/13.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "He gently picked up the egg, and held it close.",
   "t": 92.619,
   "d": 3.21,
   "file": "narration/lines/14.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "He knew he couldn't just leave it there.",
   "t": 96.609,
   "d": 2.265,
   "file": "narration/lines/15.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "scene": "egg",
   "text": "So, Tuca decided to find out where it belonged.",
   "t": 100.044,
   "d": 3.359,
   "file": "narration/lines/16.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "scene": "footprints",
   "text": "He followed a trail of enormous footprints, leading deeper into the forest.",
   "t": 106.883,
   "d": 5.292,
   "file": "narration/lines/17.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "scene": "footprints",
   "text": "Along the way, he crossed a small wooden bridge,",
   "t": 114.775,
   "d": 3.079,
   "file": "narration/lines/18.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "scene": "footprints",
   "text": "passed a sparkling waterfall,",
   "t": 122.014,
   "d": 1.832,
   "file": "narration/lines/19.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "scene": "footprints",
   "text": "and walked through a field filled with colorful flowers.",
   "t": 128.267,
   "d": 3.149,
   "file": "narration/lines/20.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "Suddenly, he heard a loud rustling sound.",
   "t": 136.806,
   "d": 2.947,
   "file": "narration/lines/21.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "Tuca stopped.",
   "t": 140.793,
   "d": 1.307,
   "file": "narration/lines/22.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "Something was moving in the bushes!",
   "t": 143.27,
   "d": 2.137,
   "file": "narration/lines/23.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "He took a small step backward.",
   "t": 146.837,
   "d": 1.93,
   "file": "narration/lines/24.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "But then... a tiny creature appeared.",
   "t": 149.417,
   "d": 2.612,
   "file": "narration/lines/25.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "It was a little dinosaur!",
   "t": 153.199,
   "d": 1.696,
   "file": "narration/lines/26.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "The baby dinosaur looked around with curious eyes.",
   "t": 156.585,
   "d": 3.441,
   "file": "narration/lines/27.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "scene": "surprise",
   "text": "Then, it noticed the egg in Tuca's arms.",
   "t": 160.806,
   "d": 2.798,
   "file": "narration/lines/28.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 29,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "The little dinosaur quickly approached, gently touching the egg with its nose.",
   "t": 165.584,
   "d": 5.332,
   "file": "narration/lines/29.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 30,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "And suddenly...",
   "t": 172.346,
   "d": 1.329,
   "file": "narration/lines/30.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 31,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "Crack!",
   "t": 174.844,
   "d": 0.732,
   "file": "narration/lines/31.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 32,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "A tiny piece of the eggshell fell to the ground.",
   "t": 177.006,
   "d": 3.011,
   "file": "narration/lines/32.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 33,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "The egg began to shake.",
   "t": 181.187,
   "d": 1.618,
   "file": "narration/lines/33.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 34,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "Tuca watched in amazement, as a tiny dinosaur head slowly appeared from inside.",
   "t": 185.015,
   "d": 6.641,
   "file": "narration/lines/34.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 35,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "It was a baby dinosaur!",
   "t": 193.086,
   "d": 1.806,
   "file": "narration/lines/35.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 36,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "The little creature blinked, looked at Tuca, and let out a tiny, happy squeak.",
   "t": 196.452,
   "d": 5.243,
   "file": "narration/lines/36.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 37,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "Tuca smiled. He had found the little dinosaur's family!",
   "t": 203.645,
   "d": 4.096,
   "file": "narration/lines/37.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 38,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "But there was still one important thing to do.",
   "t": 209.431,
   "d": 2.861,
   "file": "narration/lines/38.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 39,
   "scene": "hatch",
   "text": "They needed to find its mother.",
   "t": 213.071,
   "d": 1.929,
   "file": "narration/lines/39.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 40,
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "Following the giant footprints again, Tuca and the baby dinosaur continued their journey.",
   "t": 219.021,
   "d": 6.364,
   "file": "narration/lines/40.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 41,
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "The path became narrower, and the trees grew taller.",
   "t": 227.074,
   "d": 3.732,
   "file": "narration/lines/41.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 42,
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "The little dinosaur stayed close to Tuca, taking tiny steps along the way.",
   "t": 231.717,
   "d": 5.325,
   "file": "narration/lines/42.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 43,
   "scene": "roar",
   "text": "Then, from far away, they heard a deep and gentle roar.",
   "t": 241.022,
   "d": 4.059,
   "file": "narration/lines/43.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 44,
   "scene": "roar",
   "text": "The baby dinosaur immediately lifted its head.",
   "t": 248.2,
   "d": 3.459,
   "file": "narration/lines/44.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 45,
   "scene": "roar",
   "text": "It recognized that sound!",
   "t": 252.439,
   "d": 1.848,
   "file": "narration/lines/45.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 46,
   "scene": "roar",
   "text": "They hurried toward the noise, and finally reached a beautiful clearing.",
   "t": 255.716,
   "d": 4.776,
   "file": "narration/lines/46.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 47,
   "scene": "reunion",
   "text": "And there she was.",
   "t": 264.512,
   "d": 1.498,
   "file": "narration/lines/47.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 48,
   "scene": "reunion",
   "text": "A giant mother dinosaur stood near a large tree, looking worried, and searching everywhere.",
   "t": 267.7,
   "d": 6.284,
   "file": "narration/lines/48.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 49,
   "scene": "reunion",
   "text": "When she saw the little dinosaur, her eyes filled with happiness.",
   "t": 275.674,
   "d": 4.488,
   "file": "narration/lines/49.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 50,
   "scene": "reunion",
   "text": "The baby dinosaur ran toward her, as fast as its little legs could carry it.",
   "t": 281.592,
   "d": 5.304,
   "file": "narration/lines/50.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 51,
   "scene": "reunion",
   "text": "The mother lowered her enormous head, and gently nuzzled her baby.",
   "t": 288.326,
   "d": 4.938,
   "file": "narration/lines/51.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 52,
   "scene": "reunion",
   "text": "They were finally together again.",
   "t": 294.954,
   "d": 2.477,
   "file": "narration/lines/52.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 53,
   "scene": "goodbye",
   "text": "Tuca watched the beautiful reunion with a big smile.",
   "t": 301.911,
   "d": 3.733,
   "file": "narration/lines/53.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 54,
   "scene": "goodbye",
   "text": "The mother dinosaur turned toward him, and gently lowered her head, as if saying thank you.",
   "t": 307.074,
   "d": 6.452,
   "file": "narration/lines/54.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 55,
   "scene": "goodbye",
   "text": "Tuca waved goodbye, as the little dinosaur looked back one last time.",
   "t": 315.216,
   "d": 5.375,
   "file": "narration/lines/55.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 56,
   "scene": "goodbye",
   "text": "And then, together, they disappeared into the magical forest.",
   "t": 322.021,
   "d": 4.586,
   "file": "narration/lines/56.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 57,
   "scene": "lesson",
   "text": "That day, Tuca learned something important.",
   "t": 332.767,
   "d": 2.886,
   "file": "narration/lines/57.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 58,
   "scene": "lesson",
   "text": "Sometimes, the greatest adventures aren't about discovering new places, or finding hidden treasures.",
   "t": 337.343,
   "d": 7.598,
   "file": "narration/lines/58.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 59,
   "scene": "lesson",
   "text": "They're about helping someone, showing kindness, and making a difference.",
   "t": 346.37,
   "d": 5.038,
   "file": "narration/lines/59.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 60,
   "scene": "lesson",
   "text": "And as the sun slowly set over the forest, Tuca knew that this was an adventure he would never forget.",
   "t": 353.488,
   "d": 7.339,
   "file": "narration/lines/60.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 61,
   "scene": "lesson",
   "text": "Because every little act of kindness can lead to something truly magical.",
   "t": 363.037,
   "d": 5.896,
   "file": "narration/lines/61.wav"
  }
 ],
